          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Etii sii ine Meshek, o Tubal, tenebo olorora lenye pooki, emanita inkuraren enye ninche, lelo pooki lememurata, ootaraki to lalem; amu eidapasha ninche olkirutoto teina kop oo loishu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemeirrag ninche tenebo lelo ootabatatate magil liopa lelo ooshomo abori enemeneng'a tenebo imasaa enye olarrabal, lelo ooiteleikiaki ilalema lenye abori ilukuny enye, ore ilong'oi enye neiteleikino iloik lenye; amu ore olkirutoto le lelo tung'ana magil netii enkop e lelo ooishu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Metaa aikigili iyie nikirragieki tenebo lelo lememurata, tenebo lelo ootaraki to lalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
