              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore peyie edol Farao ninche, neilejilej kewan to lorora lenye pooki, ore Farao tenebo enjore enye pooki, naaraa to lalem ejo Olaitoriani Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eidapashayie olkirutoto te nkop oo loishu; metaa keirragieki ninye tenebo lelo lememurata, tenebo lelo ootaraki to lalem, Farao tenebo olorora lenye pooki, ejo Olaitoriani Enkai.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.32"
            ]
          }
